# =============================================================================
# Uji API langsung dari VS Code — butuh ekstensi REST Client (humao.rest-client).
# Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok. Cookie auth otomatis tersimpan.
#
# Urutan alur beli lengkap: 1 → 2 → 5 → 6 → 8 → 9 → 11 → 13 → 14
# =============================================================================

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### 0. Health check
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### 1. Registrasi user baru
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@test.id",
  "name": "Buyer Test",
  "password": "Passw0rdAman"
}

### 2. Login (cookie access + refresh diset otomatis)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@test.id",
  "password": "Passw0rdAman"
}

### 3. Profil user saat ini
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### 4. Rotasi token
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh

### 5. Daftar produk (publik) — ambil satu productId untuk checkout
# @name products
GET {{base}}/products?limit=5

### 6. Checkout
# Ganti productId dengan hasil dari request #5.
# @name checkout
POST {{base}}/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": "GANTI-DENGAN-PRODUCT-ID" }],
  "customerName": "Buyer Test",
  "customerEmail": "buyer@test.id",
  "paymentMethod": "MANUAL_TRANSFER"
}

### 7. Validasi kupon
POST {{base}}/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "HEMAT20", "subtotal": 150000 }

### 8. Detail invoice (nomor dari hasil #6: data.invoice.number)
@invoice = GANTI-DENGAN-INVOICE-NUMBER
GET {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice}}

### 9. Minta URL upload bukti transfer
# @name presign
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice}}/proof/presign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fileName": "bukti-transfer.png", "contentType": "image/png" }

### 10. Daftarkan bukti transfer (storageKey dari hasil #9)
# Catatan: unggah file-nya dulu dengan PUT ke uploadUrl (mis. dari browser/frontend).
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice}}/proof
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storageKey": "GANTI-DENGAN-STORAGE-KEY",
  "senderName": "Buyer Test"
}

### 11. [ADMIN] Daftar bukti menunggu verifikasi
# Butuh akun ADMIN (seed: admin@digitemplate.id / Admin#12345)
GET {{base}}/admin/payments?status=PENDING

### 12. [ADMIN] Login admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@digitemplate.id",
  "password": "Admin#12345"
}

### 13. [ADMIN] Setujui pembayaran (proofId dari #11)
POST {{base}}/admin/payments/GANTI-DENGAN-PROOF-ID/approve

### 14. Daftar lisensi (produk yang bisa diunduh)
# @name licenses
GET {{base}}/downloads

### 15. File dalam sebuah lisensi
GET {{base}}/downloads/GANTI-DENGAN-LICENSE-ID/files

### 16. Terbitkan signed URL unduh (berlaku 10 menit, maks 5x)
POST {{base}}/downloads/GANTI-DENGAN-LICENSE-ID/files/GANTI-DENGAN-FILE-ID/sign

### 17. [ADMIN] Statistik dashboard
GET {{base}}/admin/stats/overview

### 18. [ADMIN] Grafik penjualan 30 hari
GET {{base}}/admin/stats/sales?range=30

### 19. [ADMIN] Buat kategori
POST {{base}}/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Template POS", "sortOrder": 5 }

### 20. [ADMIN] Buat produk
POST {{base}}/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Template Invoice Modern",
  "categoryId": "GANTI-DENGAN-CATEGORY-ID",
  "description": "Deskripsi lengkap template invoice modern.",
  "shortDesc": "Invoice otomatis untuk UMKM.",
  "price": 120000,
  "discountPrice": 89000,
  "demoType": "PDF",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 21. Wishlist — tambah
POST {{base}}/wishlist
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "GANTI-DENGAN-PRODUCT-ID" }

### 22. Wishlist — lihat
GET {{base}}/wishlist

### 23. Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
